-- statement:
--   This bundle defines the question and outcome types for the recursive commute-G-half sandwich move chain. It separates two distinguished completed-slice coordinates from the tail and introduces the recursive target family after one factor is moved through the rotated half-product.
--
--   Principal definitions:
--   - `MoveQ`: the move-chain question with two distinguished coordinates and an r-tuple tail.
--   - `MoveO`: the corresponding move-chain outcome type.
--   - `MoveTailQ`: the question after exposing one tail coordinate.
--   - `MoveTailO`: the corresponding outcome type with three distinguished coordinates.
--   - `commuteGHalfSandwich_recursiveTargetFamily`: the recursive target family after one move.
